  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/ThreatManagement>
    skos:definition "A comprehensive process that encompasses identifying, assessing, and responding to potential threats, using various strategies and techniques to mitigate risks and protect organizations or individuals."@en;
    owl:versionInfo "0.1.0";
    dc:subject technicalservicesvoc:threat-management;
    core:hasLifecycleStatus core:Draft .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/Investigation>
    skos:definition "A detailed analysis of detected threats to understand their nature, origin, potential impact, and to develop an effective incident response plan, including identifying and containing the incident, mitigating damage, and recovering compromised systems."@en;
    owl:versionInfo "0.1.0";
    dc:subject technicalservicesvoc:investigation;
    core:hasLifecycleStatus core:Draft .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/Mitigation> skos:definition
      "The proactive strategies and actions taken to reduce or minimize the potential impact of threats and vulnerabilities. It involves identifying risks, implementing protective measures, and continuously monitoring for threats to prevent security breaches."@en;
    owl:versionInfo "0.1.0";
    dc:subject technicalservicesvoc:mitigation;
    core:hasLifecycleStatus core:Draft .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/Monitoring> skos:definition
      "A proactive security measure that enables organizations to detect, identify, and respond to potential security incidents in an increasingly sophisticated and pervasive era."@en;
    owl:versionInfo "0.1.0";
    dc:subject technicalservicesvoc:monitoring;
    core:hasLifecycleStatus core:Draft .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/Prevention> skos:definition
      "Proactive measures and strategies implemented to block or deter threats from reaching or damaging systems, networks, or data before they can cause harm."@en;
    owl:versionInfo "0.1.0";
    dc:subject technicalservicesvoc:prevention;
    core:hasLifecycleStatus core:Draft .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/taxonomy/core-services-technicalservices/Training> skos:definition
